    - rid: 6007911982781956804
      type: {class: DialogueRuntimeData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.RuntimeData, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        <NodeId>k__BackingField: cc125539-cfd4-42c8-9b07-0b30aa92a0ad
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: a94493c6-66cf-4741-abdb-40f752c8ce21
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <IsStartingDialogue>k__BackingField: 1
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Witaj w Internetach, przybyszu. B\u0119d\u0119 twoim
          przewodnikiem. "
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 40e656281b36f8f40b6e0ac1d6775b03, type: 3}
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8b0fb904dd04b9e4caf726c0f3ae2379, type: 3}
        LeftAdditionalImages: []
        RigthAdditionalImages: []
        <ShowPlayerResponse>k__BackingField: 0
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 6007911982781956805
      type: {class: EndGroupRuntimeData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.RuntimeData, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        <NodeId>k__BackingField: a94493c6-66cf-4741-abdb-40f752c8ce21
        <Choices>k__BackingField: []
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 7
        <IsStartingDialogue>k__BackingField: 0
        <SelectedGroup>k__BackingField: IntroDialogue
    - rid: 6007911982781956806
      type: {class: DialogueRuntimeData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.RuntimeData, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        <NodeId>k__BackingField: 4b4851de-f7ec-4108-b69e-4625904a0328
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: 3fdf0bc2-68d0-447f-9a80-5f7da9240e40
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <IsStartingDialogue>k__BackingField: 0
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Co ty, \u017Cyjesz w jaskini? To internet! "
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        LeftAdditionalImages: []
        RigthAdditionalImages: []
        <ShowPlayerResponse>k__BackingField: 0
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 6007911982781956807
      type: {class: DialogueRuntimeData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.RuntimeData, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        <NodeId>k__BackingField: 3fdf0bc2-68d0-447f-9a80-5f7da9240e40
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: 401e1762-7675-4a8d-891a-7879694fec0e
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <IsStartingDialogue>k__BackingField: 0
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Ech, widz\u0119, \u017Ce rzeczywi\u015Bcie b\u0119dziesz
          potrzebowa\u0142 przewodnika\u2026 "
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        LeftAdditionalImages: []
        RigthAdditionalImages: []
        <ShowPlayerResponse>k__BackingField: 0
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 6007911982781956808
      type: {class: DialogueRuntimeData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.RuntimeData, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        <NodeId>k__BackingField: eaa95eb5-ae7b-496f-93ab-d52f6b823853
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: 401e1762-7675-4a8d-891a-7879694fec0e
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <IsStartingDialogue>k__BackingField: 0
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Bo tak napisano w scenariuszu. Na \u017Cadn\u0105
          wi\u0119ksz\u0105 rol\u0119 si\u0119 nie zgodzi\u0142em, mam za du\u017Co
          innych projekt\xF3w. A gracze potrzebuj\u0105 takich smaczk\xF3w jak ja,
          \u017Ceby produkcja dosta\u0142a cho\u0107 ten jeden plus na Steamie. "
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        LeftAdditionalImages: []
        RigthAdditionalImages: []
        <ShowPlayerResponse>k__BackingField: 0
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 6007911982781956809
      type: {class: DialogueRuntimeData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.RuntimeData, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        <NodeId>k__BackingField: adf6fb1c-28cf-4cd7-9e78-818b9eee3f05
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: 401e1762-7675-4a8d-891a-7879694fec0e
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <IsStartingDialogue>k__BackingField: 0
        <Text>k__BackingField: "A ty co? G\u0142uchy czy pierdolni\u0119ty? Cytatu
          z Bomby te\u017C pewnie nie kojarzysz? Jestem Hed, najlepsze, co mog\u0142o
          si\u0119 przytrafi\u0107 tej amatorskiej produkcji. By\u0142y redaktor
          TVGry, Youtuber, obiekt kultu memiarzy polskiego Internetu, cz\u0142owiek-mem,
          w zasadzie. To prawie jak B\xF3g\u2026 "
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        LeftAdditionalImages: []
        RigthAdditionalImages: []
        <ShowPlayerResponse>k__BackingField: 0
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 6007911982781956810
      type: {class: QuestRuntimeData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.RuntimeData, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        <NodeId>k__BackingField: 4840918e-8d9b-4bf9-84e1-0f14adc3a10b
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Output
          <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: 5348bd82-4bde-46d1-b7d5-cc1679091c0f
